# CI/CD and release surface.
# Anything under here decides what runs in CI, which secrets that run can
# read, and what reaches an environment. A change to it deserves a review
# from whoever owns the pipeline, not just from whoever owns the app code.
# The actions entry is kept in both repos even where the directory is not
# there yet, so a composite action is owned the day someone adds one.
# Deliberately scoped: no global owner, so ordinary code changes do not put
# the pipeline owner on every pull request.

/.github/workflows/            @mime-pi
/.github/actions/              @mime-pi
/release-please-config.json    @mime-pi
/.release-please-manifest.json @mime-pi
